          "guid": "mt521fw305p6zw35",
          "message": {
            "text": "Blink rendering-context ownership propagates only across a direct parent whose used LayoutObject preserves 3D. Perspective and influenced descendants do not establish a context; a grouping/flat break resets propagation and a nested preserve node starts a fresh root. Explicit unknown facts retain the former larger Chromium surface rather than risk clipping.",
            "markdown": "Blink rendering-context ownership propagates only across a direct parent whose used LayoutObject preserves 3D. Perspective and influenced descendants do not establish a context; a grouping/flat break resets propagation and a nested preserve node starts a fresh root. Explicit unknown facts retain the former larger Chromium surface rather than risk clipping."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/projective-owner.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 110,
                  "endLine": 153,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": " */\nexport function selectProjectiveRasterOwnerIndexes(\n  nodes: readonly ProjectiveOwnershipNode[],\n): number[] {\n  const contextRoot = new Map<number, number | null>();\n  const propagated = new Map<number, number | null>();\n  for (let index = 0; index < nodes.length; index++) {\n    const node = nodes[index];\n    const inherited = node.parent == null ? null : (propagated.get(node.parent) ?? null);\n    const root = inherited ?? (node.usedPreserve3d === true ? index : null);\n    contextRoot.set(index, root);\n    propagated.set(index, node.usedPreserve3d === true ? root : null);\n  }\n  const candidates = new Set<number>();\n\n  for (let index = 0; index < nodes.length; index++) {\n    const node = nodes[index];\n    if (node == null || !node.nonAffine) continue;\n\n    let owner = contextRoot.get(index) ?? index;\n    // A missing internal used-style fact cannot authorize a smaller crop.\n    // Retain the former descendant-union owner as an explicit conservative\n    // Chromium surface until the same-frame fact becomes observable.\n    let cursor: number | null = index;\n    let unknown = false;\n    while (cursor != null) {\n      if (nodes[cursor]?.usedPreserve3d == null) unknown = true;\n      cursor = nodes[cursor]?.parent ?? null;\n    }\n    if (unknown) {\n      owner = index;\n      let parent = node.parent;\n      while (parent != null && nodes[parent]?.influenced === true) {\n        owner = parent;\n        parent = nodes[parent]?.parent ?? null;\n      }\n    }\n\n    const inlineSvgRoot = node.inlineSvgRoot;\n    if (inlineSvgRoot != null && isAncestor(nodes, inlineSvgRoot, owner)) {\n      owner = inlineSvgRoot;\n    }\n    candidates.add(owner);\n  }"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
